***DML (Data Manipulation Language)***

Used to insert, update, and delete data.

1. INSERT
INSERT INTO Employee
VALUES (101, 'Rahul', 'Nagpur', 50000);
INSERT INTO Employee
VALUES (102, 'Priya', 'Mumbai', 60000);

2. UPDATE
UPDATE Employee
SET EmpSalary = 55000
WHERE EmpID = 101;

3. DELETE
DELETE FROM Employee
WHERE EmpID = 102;
